d for cases reported in the United States stratified by age group.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"to ascertain the number of transplants performed in the United States during 2016–2020, by age group and by transplant recipient candidate weight.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"data_focus\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}